" membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely pyramid-"
"shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and it moves with an "
"uncanny fluidity on its many legs.  It is carrying an oblong object that hums"
" with an odd keening sound."
msgstr ""

